            "block_content": "The Emergency Department Technician II classification shall apply only to those Emergency Department Technicians who are regularly assigned to perform casting and/or Ortho Tech duties for at least thirty percent (30%) of their work time. This assignment may also include, but is not limited to, phlebotomy and EKG. (Reference Letter of Agreement dated 08/12/97.)",
