        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Must be responsible for continuous monitoring of patients on a centralized cardiac display module in an ICU, CCU, telemetry or stepdown care-unit. -Must be fully capable of detecting and differentiating abnormal cardiac rhythms as evidenced by a passing score on a cardiac monitoring/EKG test specified by the department manager. Must have successfully completed a course acceptable to the Employer in EKG interpretation. May be required to perform the duties of Unit Assistant as a minor proportion of the job.",
